<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves rises to $3.517 bln-Nov 13.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves rises to $3.517 bln-Nov 13.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves rose to $3.517 billion as of November 13, from $3.483 billion on November 6.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES	Nov 13    Nov 6    Nov '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	   3.517     3.483    3.046</p>
<p>  Commercial banks		1.230     1.208    1.590</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector	 4.747     4.692    4.636</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
